    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the ultimate mind game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple game in which players choose a Samurai, Ninja, Monk, Merchant, or Villager and try to guess the character selected by their opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use three types of commands: conversation, yawn, and tea to get closer to the character selected by your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has its own personality, so you need to develop a strategy based on the order in which you play them and their compatibility with your opponent's character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk until the morning in a 1-on-1 read-the-money game that requires no skill!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the ultimate mind game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple game in which players choose a Samurai, Ninja, Monk, Merchant, or Villager and try to guess the character selected by their opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use three types of commands: conversation, yawn, and tea to get closer to the character selected by your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has its own personality, so you need to develop a strategy based on the order in which you play them and their compatibility with your opponent's character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk until the morning in a 1-on-1 read-the-money game that requires no skill!</p>",
